@startuml AnalytiCore_Demo_Sequence
title AnalytiCore Note App — UI, Application Logic, Data Service & Emerging Technology
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "Local User" as User

box "User Interface" #E0F2FE
  participant "UI\n(Sidebar / Pages /\nAgentChatbox)" as UI
end box

box "Application Logic" #FEF3C7
  participant "App\n(state & orchestration)" as App
  participant "DocumentIngestion\n(extract + retrieve)" as Ingest
  participant "Analytics\n(dataset / retail)" as Analytics
end box

box "Data Service" #DCFCE7
  participant "DocumentStorage\n(client API)" as Storage
  participant "Document API\n+ MySQL" as API
end box

box "Emerging Technology" #F3E8FF
  participant "Ollama\n(Llama 3 LLM)" as Ollama
end box

== 1. Application start — restore knowledge base ==

User -> UI : Open http://localhost:3000
activate UI
UI -> App : mount / initialise
activate App
App -> Storage : loadStoredDocuments()
activate Storage
Storage -> API : GET /api/documents
activate API
API --> Storage : document metadata + extracted text
deactivate API
Storage --> App : KnowledgeDocument[0..*]
deactivate Storage
App --> UI : documentsLoaded = true\nrender pages + chat
deactivate App
UI --> User : Dashboard / Ingestion / API Setup\n+ floating Business Analyst chat
deactivate UI

== 2. Optional — configure emerging-technology endpoint ==

User -> UI : API & Model Setup\n(host, model, temperature, context)
activate UI
UI -> App : onUpdateConfig(ApiConfig)
activate App
App --> UI : apiConfig updated\n(passed to AgentChatbox)
deactivate App
deactivate UI

== 3. Data ingestion — persist business files ==

User -> UI : Upload PDF / CSV / TXT\n(Data Ingestion page)
activate UI
UI -> App : onDocumentsChange(indexing doc)
activate App
App --> UI : show indexing status

UI -> Ingest : isSupportedDocument(file)\n+ size ≤ 50 MB?
activate Ingest
alt Unsupported type or file > 50 MB
  Ingest --> UI : validation error
  UI -> App : status = error
  App --> UI : show error on document list
else Valid file
  Ingest --> UI : accepted
  deactivate Ingest

  UI -> App : onPersistDocument(document)
  App -> Storage : saveStoredDocument(document)
  activate Storage
  Storage -> API : POST /api/documents\n(metadata + original file)
  activate API
  API --> Storage : 201 created
  deactivate API
  Storage --> App : persisted
  deactivate Storage

  UI -> Ingest : extractDocumentText(file)
  activate Ingest
  alt No readable text (e.g. scanned PDF)
    Ingest --> UI : empty / extract failure
    UI -> App : onPersistDocument(status = error)
    App -> Storage : saveStoredDocument(error)
    activate Storage
    Storage -> API : PUT /api/documents/:id
    activate API
    API --> Storage : updated
    deactivate API
    Storage --> App
    deactivate Storage
    App --> UI : show extract error
  else Text extracted
    Ingest --> UI : content + tokenCount
    deactivate Ingest
    UI -> App : onPersistDocument(status = ready)
    App -> Storage : saveStoredDocument(ready + content)
    activate Storage
    Storage -> API : PUT /api/documents/:id\n(+ replace document_chunks)
    activate API
    API --> Storage : updated
    deactivate API
    Storage --> App
    deactivate Storage
    App --> UI : document ready for analytics & chat
  end
end
deactivate App
deactivate UI

== 4. Dashboard analytics (application logic only) ==

User -> UI : Open Dashboard & Analytics
activate UI
UI -> App : documents prop
activate App
App -> Analytics : getStructuredDatasets(documents)\ncombineRetailDatasets / classifyRows /\npredictWithLinearRegression / predictProductPrices
activate Analytics
Analytics --> App : metrics, charts, clusters, forecasts
deactivate Analytics
App --> UI : render HomePage / RetailCharts
deactivate App
UI --> User : live metrics & ML visualisations
deactivate UI

== 5. Agent Q&A — retrieval + emerging technology ==

User -> UI : Ask question in\nAnalytiCore Business Analyst chat
activate UI
UI -> UI : append ChatMessage(role = user)

UI -> Ingest : searchDocuments(documents, retrievalQuery)
activate Ingest
note right of Ingest
  Follow-up? merge previous + current
  Keyword score chunks (max 5)
  else representative excerpts
  Attach local table aggregates if present
end note
Ingest --> UI : retrievedContext string
deactivate Ingest

UI -> Ollama : chat({\n  model, messages = history +\n  question + retrieved excerpts,\n  temperature, num_ctx\n})
activate Ollama
note right of Ollama
  Emerging technology step:
  local Llama 3 (or selected model)
  generates the analyst answer.
  No DB / shell tools exposed.
end note

alt Endpoint reachable and non-empty answer
  Ollama --> UI : assistant message content
  UI -> UI : append ChatMessage(role = assistant)
  UI --> User : display generated answer
else Unreachable endpoint / empty response / model error
  Ollama --> UI : error / empty
  UI -> UI : append error ChatMessage
  UI --> User : show Ollama connectivity /\nmodel error guidance
end
deactivate Ollama
deactivate UI

== 6. Optional — delete stored knowledge ==

User -> UI : Delete upload
activate UI
UI -> App : onDeleteDocument(documentId)
activate App
App -> Storage : deleteStoredDocument(id)
activate Storage
Storage -> API : DELETE /api/documents/:id
activate API
API --> Storage : cascade-delete chunks + file
deactivate API
Storage --> App
deactivate Storage
App --> UI : documents list updated
deactivate App
deactivate UI

@enduml
